{"4109640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Perfect Timeline", "steam_appid": 4109640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Style</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>High-Speed Chases</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in breathless pursuits. Track down the elusive Collector while evading the relentless Pursuer in a high speed race. In these stages, speed is your only chance, and hesitation leads to erasure.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109640/extras/61f8ea054eab7b65cdff47dc894a3dff.poster.avif?t=1778265270\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109640/extras/61f8ea054eab7b65cdff47dc894a3dff.webm?t=1778265270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109640/extras/61f8ea054eab7b65cdff47dc894a3dff.mp4?t=1778265270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat-Focused Survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the race ends, the fight begins. Hold your ground against waves of hostile entities in intense, combat-heavy encounters. Use the power of your Reality Fragments to turn the tide against overwhelming odds. The combat also features <strong>roguelite playstyle</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109640/extras/52a9636bc0c75e89e64c182248ab5c72.poster.avif?t=1778265270\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109640/extras/52a9636bc0c75e89e64c182248ab5c72.webm?t=1778265270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.